# Guardrail-minimal: ONLY release-managed paths, no `*` fallback, so ordinary
# PRs never wait on code-owner review. Pair with a default-branch ruleset:
# 0 required approvals + require_code_owner_review.
# Owner is @jadb until an MXHook release team exists.
/.github/release-please-config.json     @jadb
/.github/.release-please-manifest.json  @jadb
/.github/workflows/release.yml          @jadb
/.goreleaser.yaml                       @jadb
/CHANGELOG.md                           @jadb
